mxsd documentation
==================

The documentation uses Doxygen for the C API and Sphinx/Breathe for the guide.

Linux/macOS:

  python3 -m venv .venv-docs
  . .venv-docs/bin/activate
  python -m pip install -r doc/requirements.txt
  make -C doc html

Windows PowerShell:

  py -m venv .venv-docs
  .\.venv-docs\Scripts\Activate.ps1
  python -m pip install -r doc\requirements.txt
  doc\make.bat html

The HTML entry point is doc/_build_sphinx/html/index.html.

